SUMMARY:Oedipus Rex: A Community Read-Aloud NEW
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to 
 register.\n\nThere's no better way to appreciate a classical masterpiece 
 than by participating in it! Join Mary English\, the classics chair of 
 Montclair State University\, to read aloud in turns from the legendary 
 Oedipus Rex. We'll discuss the play after we read it.\n\nClick here to 
 purchase the book.\n\n
