 fancy!\nRegistration required.\n\n\nPhoto credit: Maxie Elise\n\nYou can 
 learn more about Book Bedazzling and see samples here.\nThis event is 
 happening at the Main Library (50 S. Fullerton Ave). You can register for 
 Teen Book Bedazzling @ BAB HERE. You are more than welcome to attend both 
 sessions!
