SUMMARY:Mocktail Mixology Class with Raven's Reserve
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a fun and interactive hands-on workshop where 
 participants learn how to craft delicious alcohol-free mocktails using 
 fresh ingredients\, simple syrups\, and professional mixing techniques. 
 Guided step-by-step instruction covers flavor balancing\, garnishing\, and 
 presentation while guests create multiple drinks of their own. Perfect for 
 adults looking for a creative and social experience — no prior experience 
 required.\n\n \n\nRegistration is required\, space is limited.\n\nAll 
 materials will be provided.
