SUMMARY:Community Tech Day
DESCRIPTION:Hosted by Lacordaire Academy Girls Who Code Chapter!\n\nJoin 
 our amazing Teen Volunteers from Lacordaire Academy for a community tech 
 day. Seniors are invited to bring their devices in for troubleshooting and 
 tech support.\n\nWe'll cover the following topics:\n\n\n	Basics (Sending 
 text messages\, Adjusting settings\, Installing apps\, Using voice 
 assistants (Siri))\n	Internet Safety (Recognizing scams\, safe passwords\, 
 protecting personal information)\n	Email/Video Calls (Send emails\, attach 
 photos\, using video call apps)\n	Photo/Memories (Deleting photos\, 
 Creating albums\, and Sharing photos)\n\n\nRegistration required -- please 
 reserve your timeslot here.
