DESCRIPTION:Come and join us for a culinary delight.  Veteran gardener Mary 
 Silvestri will discuss the benefits of gardening.  Mary will demonstrate 
 how to make all natural\, healthy sauces using your homegrown vegetables.  
 These recipes require 5 ingredients or less.  They are quick and easy to 
 prep and can be served as appetizers\, for a holiday meal or at a picnic. 
 Three veggie sauces will be prepped and you will get a chance to try one of 
 them.  Registration is required.  Participants will need to sign a waiver.
