DTSTART:20260509T190000Z
DTEND:20260509T194500Z
DTSTAMP:20260509T000000Z
SUMMARY:Yoga for Littles & Grownups
DESCRIPTION:Make your weekend extra special with a relaxing yoga session 
 for littles (ages 2 years and up) and their grownups! (No unaccompanied 
 grownups\, please.) Instructor Brittany Martorella will lead you through 
 gentle yoga poses and breathing exercises to help achieve inner peace. 
 Registration required.\n\nParticipants should wear socks and bring their 
 own bath/beach towels or yoga mats.\n\nMeet your instructor:\nBrittany 
 Martorella is a seasoned yoga teacher with over a decade of experience 
 honing her craft. Originally certified by Yoga to the People in NYC\, 
 Brittany's journey has led her to share her expertise internationally\, 
 from the bustling streets of NYC and Brooklyn to the serene landscapes of 
 Costa Rica\, where she studied and taught at Peace Retreat. Specializing in 
 Vinyasa\, Brittany's classes offer a dynamic blend of movement and breath\, 
 invigorating the body and soothing the soul. Her love for restorative 
 postures provides students with a chance to deeply relax and 
 rejuvenate.\nWith her infectious laughter\, she loves to remind her 
 students that yoga is meant to be fun. She creates an atmosphere of 
 light-heartedness and levity\, setting the stage for true calm and zen 
 focus in every class. Join Brittany on the mat and let's laugh\, flow\, and 
 grow together!
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Green Room\, Montclair Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Library":MAILTO:events@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Adult Services, Children's Programs, Fitness, Health & Wellness
UID:LibCal-10306-16614228
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/16614228
END:VEVENT
