SUMMARY:Graphic Novel Book Club (18 )
DESCRIPTION:Discover Ben Wickey’s More Weight\, a striking graphic novel 
 that brings the Salem Witch-Hunt to life and examines its enduring legacy. 
 \n\nMore Weight by Ben Wickey\n\n"Stunningly illustrated and meticulously 
 researched... a stark\, often brutal reminder of what happens when fear and 
 superstition go unchecked." — Book Riot\n\nCopies of the book will be 
 available to pick up at the BAB Library. Check out on the digital app 
 Hoopla as well!\n\nRegistration is required.\n\nThis book club is exclusive 
 for those 18 or older\, as some materials may contain content not suitable 
 for younger audiences.\n\n\n
