SUMMARY:One-on-One Tech Support Sessions - with Montclair Gateway to Aging in Place
DESCRIPTION:Please note: This program has been moved to the Montclair HUB 
 building next to the library\, 60 South Fullerton Ave.\n\n\nIn today’s 
 digital age\, technology has become an integral part of our daily lives. 
 While younger generations effortlessly navigate through smartphones and 
 computers\, many senior citizens have felt left behind. However\, with the 
 advent of technology improvement classes (SS/ST Classes) tailored 
 specifically for seniors\, their lives have undergone a remarkable 
 transformation!\n\nMontclair Gateway to Aging in Place is offering drop-in 
 one-on-one tech support. Bring your device and your questions.\n\nPlease 
 register!\n\nContact support@montclairgateway.com for additional questions.
LOCATION:Montclair Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Library":MAILTO:events@montclairlibrary.org
