SUMMARY:Stuffed Animal Night at the Library
DESCRIPTION:Do you ever wonder what your stuffies would be up to if they 
 spent the night at the library?\n\nMaybe they would stay up all night 
 reading books or laughing with other stuffies?\n\nIf this sounds like an 
 adventure for your stuffy\, bring them to third floor of the Montclair 
 Public Library Friday May 15th for a night of library shenanigans with 
 other local stuffies.\n\nDrop off time is from 4pm to 5pm\n\n(We encourage 
 you to drop off stuffies that your child will not need for bedtime that 
 night\, something they can easily say goodnight to.)\n\nRegistration 
 Required as it will help us prepare for the stuffies overnight of 
 fun.\n\nWe'll have pick up for your stuffy Saturday morning accompanied by 
 a 10:30am storytime.\n\n
