SUMMARY:The Joyful Art of Paper Folding NEW
DESCRIPTION:This is a free Adult School class. Click below to 
 register.\n\nIn the Philippines\, the young and the old love paper folding. 
 They feel a sense of connection with their family and community by folding 
 single sheets of paper to create beautiful objects\, presenting them as 
 thoughtful\, handmade gifts for loved ones.\n\nPaper folding is an 
 enjoyable\, creative\, and meditative art form: transforming flat pieces of 
 paper to three-dimensional objects. Through hands-on demonstrations and 
 one-on-one instructions\, students will learn and make simple to intricate 
 structures\, creating toys\, flowers\, birds\, and utilitarian 
 objects.\n\nAn accessible art\, suitable for beginners and experienced 
 folders\, paper folding promotes mindfulness and relaxation. It improves 
 fine and gross motor skills\, spatial perception\, and has other cognitive 
 benefits.\n\n
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Auditorium\, Montclair Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Adult School":MAILTO:adultschool@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Adult School, Arts & Crafts, Lectures / History & Culture
